            <li><strong>Zero Dopamine Loops:</strong> There are no timers, no points, no coins, and no noisy pop-ups—just authentic wildlife sounds and child-led curiosity.</li>
            <li><strong>Try Free, Own Forever:</strong> Download and explore for free, then unlock the entire world forever with a single one-time purchase. Zero ads, zero accounts, and 100% offline.</li>
